    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20696" root="سيرج" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سمرج</span></b>  [written without any syll. signs, and
therefore probably <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمْرَجْ</span>,] sing. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمَارِجُ</span>, (TA,)
which signifies <i>Even,</i> or <i>plain, places</i> [or <i>tracts</i>]
<i>of land.</i> (T, * Ibn-'Abbád, O, TA. *)

